# A: hands-off drift, 70 s at a 0.5 m hover, fly-landed with the pad gate off (A1 fusion 2, A2 fusion 3)
# Fly it: fly lab_a_hover --once, with camera_truth.sh fusion <name> 2|3 --yaw-deg 94 running. Pass (PROPOSED):
# camera truth moves < 20 cm over 60 s; read the camera landing line. Plan: docs/lab/run-sheet-2026-10-14.md
campaign lab-a-hover
rate 50
log estimator_truth optical_flow velocity_loops takeoff_gate thrust_model ekf_states camera_fusion drift_nn
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=0
takeoff 0.5
hold 70
land
